## Level 2 (alternate): Problem to Solution — Before/After State

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Before

    state "Before: browser-only redaction" as Before {
        [*] --> WatchesPage
        WatchesPage --> RedactsOnPaste : content script sees paste event\non claude.ai / chatgpt.com
        RedactsOnPaste --> BlindElsewhere : copy from Mail, Slack, IDE
        BlindElsewhere : no interception point outside the DOM\nPII reaches the AI chat unredacted
    }

    Before --> After : PR #1 adds desktop/ SecurePII

    state "After: system clipboard redaction" as After {
        [*] --> PollsClipboard
        PollsClipboard --> AttributesApp : clipboard-monitor.ts, every 500ms
        AttributesApp --> ChecksExclusions : attribution.ts / lsappinfo-parser.ts
        ChecksExclusions --> PassesThrough : app on exclusion list
        ChecksExclusions --> Redacts : app not excluded
        Redacts --> StoresOriginal : clipboard-decision.ts rewrites\nto [ssn:8a1f2c04]
        StoresOriginal --> RestoresOnCopy : records-store.ts looks up id\non copy back out
    }

    After --> [*]
```

